{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0judwvq1","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":70,"top":235,"width":525,"height":325},"text":"C总价9000元最低，但10天交期超过9天要求。\n\nA总价9240元、7天交付，可优先考虑。\n\nB总价9300元，需确认交期。","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#F3F4F5","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#25282E","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lk3up0r6","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":670,"top":235,"width":540,"height":325},"text":"A  100×80×1.13+200 = 9240元\n     7天，满足\n\nB  100×88+500 = 9300元\n     未提供交期，保留未知\n\nC  100×90 = 9000元\n     10天，不满足","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#FFF0F0","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Microsoft YaHei","color":"#25282E","alignment":"left"}}
